{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wangwei-p-fdec2a39e1811e","name":"李斯","evidence":["wangwei-q-d4090e8d7349ef3809d7"],"facts":[{"id":"wangwei-f-5ee2cb80d510501176bc","text":"《四体书势》称秦时工篆，诸山铜人铭皆其书。","evidence":["wangwei-q-d4090e8d7349ef3809d7"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wangwei-q-d4090e8d7349ef3809d7","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-3486a7583febb14de673","layer":"pei","quote":"其序篆书曰：“秦时李斯号为工篆，诸山及铜人铭皆斯书也。汉建初中，扶风曹喜少异于斯而亦称善；邯郸淳师焉，略究其妙。韦诞师淳，而不及也。太和中，诞为武都太守，以能书留补侍中；魏氏宝器铭题，皆诞书云。汉末又有蔡邕采斯、喜之法，为古今杂形；然精密简理不如淳也。”","attribution":"裴注引卫恒《四体书势》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9886d275cee1012511a7","start":0,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
